invariant: INV-36
file: chapulin_ticket.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: Ticket.fromOnTicket zeroes the ticket's QUIC version when it
  copies what on_ticket handed over, so init refuses to resume with it.
  The full handshake still completes, so only a resumption notices.
  loop_quic.zig resumes the ticket it took, in version 1 and in version
  2, and objects.
--- old
        if (c.ch_ticket_save(@ptrCast(&out), ticket) != c.CH_OK) return null;
--- new
        if (c.ch_ticket_save(@ptrCast(&out), ticket) != c.CH_OK) return null;
        if (@hasField(c.ch_ticket, "quic_version")) out.ticket.quic_version = 0;
